<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7780 TO DLR.</title>
<headline>KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7780 TO DLR.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7780 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.8000 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 7		   Aug 6</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.7980</p>
<p> Low				75.5500		 75.5500</p>
<p> Open			     75.5500		 75.5500</p>
<p> Close			    75.7780		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    1.715		   1.095</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509 410</p>
